{
  "children": [
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "SOP-CHEM-014: Preparation of Piranha solution and cleaning of silicon substrates",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "Title"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Version 3.1 · Approved by: T. Safety · Review due: September 2027",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "Author"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Purpose and scope",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "This SOP describes the preparation and use of Piranha solution (3:1 H₂SO₄ : H₂O₂) to remove organic residues from Si wafers. It applies to all users of fume hood FH-3 in the Materials Chemistry laboratory.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Hazards",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "rows": [
        [
          "Hazard",
          "Severity",
          "Likelihood",
          "Risk",
          "Control"
        ],
        [
          "Violent exotherm / explosion with organics",
          "5",
          "2",
          "10",
          "Never mix with solvents; small volumes"
        ],
        [
          "Severe chemical burns",
          "4",
          "2",
          "8",
          "Face shield, acid apron, neoprene gloves"
        ],
        [
          "Pressure build-up in closed vessel",
          "5",
          "1",
          "5",
          "Never cap; label and leave to cool open"
        ],
        [
          "Spill",
          "3",
          "2",
          "6",
          "Spill kit at FH-3; bund tray"
        ]
      ],
      "caption": "Risk assessment (risk = severity × likelihood, 1–25).",
      "label": "tab:risk",
      "alignment": "lcccl",
      "style": "booktabs",
      "type": "Table"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Personal protective equipment",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Full face shield over safety goggles",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Acid-resistant apron and lab coat",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Heavy neoprene or butyl gloves over nitrile",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Closed shoes; work only with a second person present",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        }
      ],
      "type": "List"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Procedure",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Clear the fume hood of all organic solvents and combustibles.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Place a clean Pyrex beaker in the bund tray.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Add 30 mL concentrated H₂SO₄ (96 %).",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Slowly add 10 mL H₂O₂ (30 %) — ALWAYS peroxide to acid. The mixture will reach ~120 °C.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Immerse wafers with PTFE tweezers for 15 min.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Rinse in three successive DI-water baths, then blow dry with N₂.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Allow the solution to cool completely (≥ 2 h) in the open beaker before disposal.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        }
      ],
      "type": "List"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "The heat released on mixing can be estimated from the enthalpy of dilution; for 30 mL of acid the temperature rise is roughly",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "latex": "\\Delta T \\approx \\frac{n\\,|\\Delta H_{\\text{dil}}|}{m\\,c_p} \\approx \\frac{0.54 \\times 45\\,000}{56 \\times 2.0} \\approx 2\\times 10^2\\ \\text{K (upper bound)},",
      "numbered": true,
      "label": "eq:heat",
      "type": "MathBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "which is why peroxide must be added slowly.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Waste disposal",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Cooled Piranha is collected in the labelled vented container “Piranha waste — do not cap tightly”. Never pour into the general acid-waste drum.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Emergency procedures",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Skin contact: drench in safety shower ≥ 15 min, remove contaminated clothing, call first aider.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Eye contact: eyewash ≥ 15 min, seek medical attention.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Spill > 50 mL: evacuate, call emergency number 2222.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        }
      ],
      "type": "List"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Record of training",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
